# MSYS2/mingw-w64 GNU linker shim (x86_64-pc-windows-gnu, Windows-without-MSVC
# hosts). The SOURCE (src-tauri/toolchain/linker_wrap.c) and its generator
# (scripts/build/ensure_gnu_linkchain.py) ARE tracked, so a deleted or
# AV-quarantined wrapper is always rebuildable with one command. Only the
# build outputs are ignored. Never add src-tauri/toolchain/ here.
src-tauri/.toolchain/
src-tauri/.cargo/
